  "description": "The ToolUp SDK's static analyser rule set (FSharp.Analyzers.SDK): Remoting API methods missing an authorisation classification (TUR0001) or, opt-in, an audit annotation (TUR0002); container resolution outside service registration (TUA001); an HttpClient built without the platform egress handler (TUA002); Async.RunSynchronously outside a program entry point (TUA003). Each rule is the compile-time half of a runtime check. Pure tooling; references nothing at runtime.",
